{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55667","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 六十五 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 六十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栖真境界太玄乡，静见吾宗不可量。\n好句只凭诗断送，闲缘唯遣道消亡。\n雨丝云织轻条密，烟素风抽细缕长。\n竟日虚怀无一事，金瓶秋水石炉香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55667.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55667","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}